  "name": "corn-sprite",
  "description": "A custom RISC-V 64-bit kernel coupled with a verified bytecode runtime and compiler toolchain. The system implements core OS primitives including Sv39 paging, preemptive scheduling, and an in-memory VFS, while offloading userland execution to a specialized VM that statically verifies bytecode safety before execution.",
